{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["And the sense of <b>and let my name be called upon them</b>: Rabbi Abraham said that they are called Israel after the name of Ephraim, just as they are called the seed of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob. But this is not correct, for Scripture says \"on them,\" and behold they were not named after Manasseh. Perhaps it is because they are called \"the house of Joseph.\" But the correct interpretation is that their seed and their name shall endure, and the name of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob shall be remembered upon them forever."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:46:32.903172610Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}